      "st.title": "Accessibility statement",
      "st.intro": "OSCAR Boutique is committed to equal service for every customer, including people with disabilities. This website was built to meet Israel's Equal Rights for Persons with Disabilities (Service Accessibility Adjustments) Regulations, 2013, and Israeli Standard IS 5568, which is based on WCAG 2.0 level AA. It was also designed to meet WCAG 2.1 level AA.",
      "st.featuresTitle": "What we've done",
      "st.features": [
        "Full keyboard navigation, with a clear outline on whatever has focus",
        "Screen reader support: headings, labelled fields, image descriptions and announcements when the page changes",
        "A skip-to-content link at the top of every page",
        "Sufficient color contrast, plus a high-contrast mode",
        "Text can be enlarged to 130% without breaking the page",
        "Animations can be stopped, and your device's reduced-motion setting is respected",
        "Hebrew and Arabic right to left, plus English and Russian"
      ],
      "st.menuTitle": "The accessibility menu",
      "st.menu": "The accessibility button sits in the corner of every page. Use it to change text size, contrast, link underlines, font, line spacing and animations. Your settings are saved in your browser.",
      "st.storeTitle": "Accessibility at the boutique",
      "st.store": "For details on physical access at the boutique, call us before you come. We'll gladly help and prepare for your visit.",
      "st.limitsTitle": "Known limitations",
      "st.limits": "Some parts of the site may not yet be fully accessible. If you run into a problem, please tell us and we'll fix it.",
      "st.contactTitle": "Accessibility contact",
      "st.name": "Accessibility coordinator", "st.phone": "Phone", "st.address": "Address", "st.tbd": "To be updated", "st.owner": "The business owner, OSCAR",
      "st.updated": "Statement last updated: November 2026",
      "pol.title": "Store policies",
      "pol.draft": "Draft: the business owner should complete the final wording, ideally with a lawyer.",
      "pol.termsTitle": "Terms of use", "pol.terms": "This site is run by OSCAR, a designer-wear boutique at 73 Herzl St, Ramla, Israel. Phone and WhatsApp: 054-678-9446.\nAn order placed on the site is sent to us on WhatsApp and isn't binding until we confirm it. When we confirm, we tell you whether the piece and size are available, the final price, any delivery cost and how to pay. The sale is complete only once the order is confirmed and paid.\nPrices on the site are in shekels and include VAT. Prices in other currencies are shown for convenience only, at an approximate rate. Sales and promo codes are valid for the period stated and don't combine unless stated otherwise.\nPhotos show the pieces as faithfully as possible, but colours may look slightly different on screen. We recommend coming in for a fitting.\nAlterations: our in-store seamstress fits the piece to your measurements. Alterations are made by arrangement and with your approval, and if they carry a charge, we tell you the price in advance.",
      "pol.returnsTitle": "Cancellations, returns & exchanges", "pol.returns": "You may cancel an order made remotely (on the site, on WhatsApp or by phone) within 14 days of receiving the item or the document with the order details, whichever is later. Customers aged 65 and over, people with disabilities and new immigrants may cancel a purchase that involved a conversation with the boutique within 4 months, as the law provides.\nYou can cancel on WhatsApp, by phone on 054-678-9446, or in the boutique.\nThe item should come back in its original condition, unworn and with its tags. We refund you within 14 days of receiving the cancellation, less a cancellation fee of 5% of the price or ₪100, whichever is lower. A faulty item, or one different from what you ordered, is exchanged or refunded in full with no cancellation fee.\nAn item that has been altered or tailored to your measurements can't be cancelled once the work has begun, to the extent the law allows.\nExchanges for another piece or size are possible by arrangement, subject to stock.",
      "pol.shippingTitle": "Delivery", "pol.shipping": "You can collect your order free of charge from the boutique at 73 Herzl St, Ramla, during opening hours.\nDelivery to your address is by arrangement. The delivery cost and estimated delivery time are given when we confirm your order, before you pay.\nIf a piece is delayed or out of stock, we let you know right away and offer another date, another piece or a full refund.",
      "pol.privacyTitle": "Privacy", "pol.privacy": "To handle an order or a fitting request we ask for your name and phone number, and where needed a delivery address, email and notes. These details reach us in a WhatsApp message sent from your phone or computer, and are used only to handle your order and contact you about it. We don't sell them or pass them on, except to a courier when something needs delivering.\nThe site saves your bag, language, currency and accessibility settings in your browser so they're there on your next visit. The site has no advertising or tracking cookies.\nTo show the site, fonts load from Google Fonts, exchange rates from ExchangeRate-API and the catalogue from the site's data service (Supabase). Like any website, these services see your IP address.\nYou can ask to see, correct or delete your information on WhatsApp or by phone on 054-678-9446.",
      "footer.rights": "© {year} OSCAR Boutique, Ramla. All rights reserved.", "footer.credit": "Website design and development: {name}", "pol.ip": "All content on this site, including photos, texts, the logo and the design, belongs to OSCAR Boutique and the site designer and is protected by copyright. It may not be copied, reproduced or used without written permission. Website design and development: AVI SHINI.", "footer.rates": "Exchange rates:", "footer.ratesLive": "updated {date}",
